# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Medical imaging data - NEVER commit.
# BraTS 2020 is distributed under a data use agreement that forbids
# redistribution. Download it yourself (see README) and point
# BRATS_DATA_ROOT at your local copy.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.nii
*.nii.gz
*.mha
*.mhd
*.dcm
*.npy
*.npz
data/
BraTS*/
MICCAI_BraTS*/
*BraTS2020*/

